---
import Base from '@/templates/Base.astro';
import { sitePath } from '@/utils/paths.mjs';
---

<Base head={{ title: 'Privacy | WeiKnight', description: 'Privacy information for the WeiKnight personal site.' }} theme='real'>
  <main class='mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-5 py-12 font-formal-sans text-real-text sm:py-16'>
    <a href={sitePath('/')} class='text-sm text-real-accent hover:underline'>← Home</a>
    <article class='prose prose-base prose-invert prose-slate mt-10 max-w-none prose-headings:font-black prose-a:text-real-accent prose-strong:text-white md:prose-lg'>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated: November 13, 2026</strong></p>
      <p>This personal website publishes static pages generated from source files and Markdown content, hosted on GitHub Pages.</p>

      <h2>Browser preferences</h2>
      <p>The site stores your language and color theme choices in your browser’s local storage. These preferences stay on your device and are used to display the site as you prefer. You can remove them by clearing this site’s browser data.</p>

      <h2>Hosting and external resources</h2>
      <p>GitHub Pages processes requests to deliver these pages and may collect technical information such as IP addresses and request logs under <a href='https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>GitHub’s privacy statement</a>.</p>
      <p>Pages load fonts from Google Fonts. Your browser contacts Google to retrieve the font styles and files; Google’s privacy policy applies to those requests.</p>
      <p>The site does not add analytics, advertising trackers, or application cookies.</p>

      <h2>Links and contact</h2>
      <p>External links lead to services with their own privacy policies. If you contact me by email, your message is handled by the email providers involved and used to respond to your inquiry.</p>
      <p>This policy may be updated when the site or its hosting changes. Questions can be sent to <a href='mailto:weiknight0@outlook.com'>weiknight0@outlook.com</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
